de ea re edita sint vel non,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0325">BETHMANNUS (Lud. Conrad.).</P> <P COM="0325">Notitia in Robertum de Torinnaeo, CCII, 1306. — In
