47. Illius educatio,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Levita et diaconus efficitur, 48.
A B. Sixto ad sedem episcopalem Ravennatis attollitur, 49.
 <COL N="0375"></COL> Mox consecratur, 50. Illius gesta et mores, 51  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seqq.</HI> 
