 <HI REND="ITALIC">praefat.</HI></P> <P COM="0392">SCULTETUS sive SCHULTZIUS (Barthol.) Gertiziae
natus an. 1540, et defunctus an. 1610. Ipsius est analysis
libri de ira Dei, Lactantii, VII, 77.</P> <P COM="0392">SELDENUS (Joannes), eruditus archaeologus in Anglia
