Fabianum fragmenta XXXIX. 14. Duo sermones hactenus
inediti, in Circumcisione Domini, in Purificatione
B. Virginis Mariae, LXV, 104  <HI REND="ITALIC">seq.</HI></P> <P COM="0584">FULGENTIUS, Affligemensis abbas, an. 1125. Epistola
